============================================
CAMPUS EVENTS HUB - Project README
============================================

HOW TO RUN THE WEBSITE:

1. Copy the entire "campus-events-hub" folder to your XAMPP htdocs directory:
   C:\xampp\htdocs\campus-events-hub\

2. Start XAMPP and ensure Apache is running.

3. Open your web browser and navigate to:
   http://localhost/campus-events-hub/

4. The home page (index.php) will load. You can navigate through all pages.

PROJECT STRUCTURE:
- index.php          : Home page with event highlights
- events.php         : List of all events
- event-details.php  : Single event details (use ?id= parameter)
- register.php       : Event registration form
- registrations.php  : List of all registrations
- about.php          : About us and contact form
- assets/css/        : External stylesheets
- includes/          : Shared PHP components (header, footer, config)
- data/              : CSV data files (events and registrations)

TECHNICAL NOTES:
- PHP is required (XAMPP/WAMP/MAMP).
- Data is stored in CSV files for simplicity.
- No external frameworks or libraries are used.
- All validation is done server-side with PHP.
